{
  "name": "Athlete",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Strength or Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Climb Speed.</strong> You gain a Climb Speed equal to your Speed.</p><p><strong>Hop Up.</strong> When you have the &amp;Reference[Prone] condition, you can right yourself with only 5 feet of movement.</p><p><strong>Jumping.</strong> You can make a running &amp;Reference[Long Jump]{Long} or &amp;Reference[High Jump] after moving only 5 feet.</p><section id=\"secret-HwMnjjLPfn97FUqL\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feat does not automate the effects. You can add your Climb Speed by toggling the \"Edit\" mode of your sheet and clicking on the \"Gear\" icon above \"Walk\" (Just above your Hit Point bar).</p></section>",
